  cookingInstructions:
  - Slice the pork belly.
  - Slice the chicken liver.
  - Slice the kikiam.
  - Slice the garlic.
  - Turn the stove to high heat.
  - Put the wok on the stove
  - Add 1/4 cup of cooking oil.
  - Add the garlic.
  - "Saut\xE9 until fragrant."
  - Add the pork belly.
  - Add the chicken liver.
  - Add the chicken broth.
  - Add 1/4 cup of soy sauce.
  - Add 1 tbsp of fish sauce.
  - Put the lid on the wok to simmer.
  - Add the noodles.
  - Add 1 tbsp of cassava starch.
  - Stir using the spatula.
  - Add the kikiam.
  - Add the beaten eggs.
